  "note": "Only with UNWRAP_SINGLE_VALUE_ARRAYS on (off by default), which the call graph cannot see, so reaching these means the service deserializes primitive values at all. The fix patches _deserializeWrappedValue, the seven _parseXxxPrimitive methods and _parseDateFromArray in StdDeserializer. On 2.5.0 the unwrap sits in the boxed _parseBoolean, _parseByte, _parseShort, _parseInteger, _parseLong, _parseFloat, _parseDouble, _parseString and _parseDate instead, so those are listed too; _parseBytePrimitive and _parseDateFromArray are absent there.",
